<quiz><question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>LIFE TABLES (Single Decrement Tables)-Applications_q2</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Use the Australian Life Table \((1960-62)-\text{A}^{\text{M}61}\) given below to answer the question that follows.</p>
<p><strong style="color: blue;">
 <a href="https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&id=1dHL475YTEIDlS58Y3CJE17vPBCGd2aCj">Download Life Table Data </a>
</strong></p>
<p><b>Note:</b> Give your answer to \(4\) decimal places</p>


<p>What is the chance that a female aged  \({@age_female@}\) and a male aged  \({@age_male@}\) will both die within \({@age@}\) years?</p>
<p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>

<p>The chance that a female aged \({@age_female@}\) will die within \({@age@}\) years is</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \frac{l_{@age_female@}-l_{@female_die@}}{l_{@age_female@}}=\frac{{@num_female_dying@}-{@num_female_dying_age@}}{{@num_female_dying@}}=\frac{{@num_female_dying-num_female_dying_age@}}{{@num_female_dying@}}\)</p>
<p>The chance that a male aged \({@age_male@}\) will die within \({@age@}\) years is</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \frac{l_{@age_male@}-l_{@male_die@}}{l_{@age_male@}}=\frac{{@num_male_dying@}-{@num_male_dying_age@}}{{@num_male_dying@}}=\frac{{@num_male_dying-num_male_dying_age@}}{{@num_male_dying@}}\)</p>
<p>The chance that that both will die within \({@age@}\) years is</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle \frac{l_{@age_female@}-l_{@female_die@}}{l_{@age_female@}}= \frac{l_{@age_male@}-l_{@male_die@}}{l_{@age_male@}}\)</p>
<p>\(\displaystyle ={@chance_male_die@} \times {@chance_female_die@}\)</p>

<p>\(\displaystyle ={@ta@}\)</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
